WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.640
We are going to cross the road. Here is what will happen.

2
00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:11.688
We stop at the curb. We do not step into the road yet.

3
00:00:11.688 --> 00:00:17.664
We look for the green walking man. Green means we can go.

4
00:00:17.664 --> 00:00:25.152
We look left, then right, then left again. No cars close is good.

5
00:00:25.152 --> 00:00:29.016
We hold a grown-up's hand if we need to.

6
00:00:29.016 --> 00:00:33.216
We walk straight across, not running.

7
00:00:33.216 --> 00:00:36.888
We step onto the other pavement.

8
00:00:36.888 --> 00:00:41.280
All done. We crossed safely.

9
00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:49.488
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

